    "level": "SHORTS",
    "overview": "On the other hand и on the contrary оба могут связывать идеи, но выражают разные отношения.",
    "main_rule": "On the other hand introduces another side/aspect of an issue. On the contrary directly contradicts or corrects a previous statement/assumption.",
    "form": "Sentence. On the other hand, sentence. / On the contrary, sentence.",
    "when_why": "Используй on the other hand, когда показываешь другую сторону; on the contrary — когда говоришь «наоборот, это не так».",
    "examples": "The job is well paid. On the other hand, the hours are long. → Работа хорошо оплачивается. С другой стороны, часы длинные.\n“I thought the task was difficult.” “On the contrary, it was quite easy.” → «Я думал, задание сложное». «Наоборот, оно довольно лёгкое».",
    "special_cases": "On the contrary requires direct contradiction/correction, not merely different information.",
    "common_mistakes": "❌ Two different facts = automatically on the contrary. → Нет; often on the other hand.\n✅ On the contrary, it was easy. → direct correction.",
    "dont_confuse": "other hand = another aspect.\ncontrary = opposite of what was suggested.",
    "quick_summary": "on the other hand = другой аспект.\non the contrary = прямое опровержение."
  },
